# Experiment 1: Batch Processing Case Study – Student Marks Analysis

## Description

This experiment demonstrates batch processing using Python and Pandas to analyze student marks.

## Files

- Experiment_01.ipynb
- Experiment_01_Report.pdf
- students_marks.csv

## Requirements

- Python 3.x
- Jupyter Notebook
- Pandas

```bash
pip install pandas
```

## Running the Experiment

1. Open `Experiment_01.ipynb`.
2. Run all cells in sequence.
